@startuml cicd-pipeline
!include _style.puml
skinparam wrapWidth 210

|Developer|
start
:Open a pull request
to main;
|GitHub Actions|
:Check the backend (generate
client, build images with Aspire)
and the frontend (production
build, bundle budget);
|Developer|
:Merge, or push to the
staging / production
branch;
|GitHub Actions|
:Build the API, generate the
OpenAPI specification
and commit it;
:Build the API and web images
with Aspire, push them to GHCR
(tag latest, staging or production);
|Kubernetes|
:Restart the backend
and web deployments
of the environment;
|GitHub Actions|
if (ArtMeasure changed?\n(main and staging only)) then (yes)
  :Build ArtMeasure
  (PyInstaller, Linux
  and Windows);
else (no)
endif
stop
@enduml
